  "ingredients": [
    "1 (14.1 ounce) package double-crust pie pastry, thawed",
    "0.5 cup white sugar",
    "3 tablespoons all-purpose flour",
    "1 teaspoon ground cinnamon",
    "1 teaspoon lemon zest",
    "0.25 teaspoon salt",
    "5 cups peeled and sliced pears",
    "1 tablespoon butter",
    "1 tablespoon lemon juice"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 450 degrees F (230 degrees C). Place a baking sheet on the bottom oven rack.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/2dq1zuecoNGTAKYELVVvKpMAhdY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12275-fresh-pear-pie-VAT-step-01-3f9b2a5a62a74a9997a3dd3860870648.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12275/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Line the bottom and sides of a 9-inch pie plate with one pie crust. Set second crust aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/1Ec2325zgqbrHHK7sdDKjl4Qdvg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12275-fresh-pear-pie-VAT-step-02-df0b16e142794ac7bb560773995a53d0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12275/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine sugar, flour, cinnamon, lemon zest, and salt in a mixing bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/WAbUJUPkgw_uIFRtaOMXuWplQKg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12275-fresh-pear-pie-VAT-step-03-2dc18e02e1464d9289c9ddab037df3a5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12275/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Arrange pear slices in layers in prepared crust, sprinkling sugar mixture over each layer. Dot with butter and sprinkle with lemon juice.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/exSV0FnGY6mMr3PsieYJaou4k9A=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12275-fresh-pear-pie-VAT-step-04-0d597b4b3a0a487881af2ed8814126fb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12275/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Moisten the rim of bottom crust with some water, then cover filling with remaining pie crust and flute the edges to seal; trim off excess pastry and cut several slits in top crust to allow steam to escape.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/m8coBbRBxenGBz-Fio9snbiaYhA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12275-fresh-pear-pie-VAT-step-05-4bb42aaae1674923b7f1bae0338e7019.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12275/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven on the baking sheet for 10 minutes. Reduce oven temperature to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C); bake until crust is golden brown and filling is bubbly, 35 to 40 minutes longer.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
